# Allowlist (owner, 2026-10-01): the public repository holds the source, the manual and the specs, and
# nothing else. Everything is ignored unless re-allowed below; the working notes, tests, tools and
# operating scripts live in the sibling private repository and are linked in locally.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/README.ko.md
!/LICENSE
!/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!/DECISIONS.md
!/Makefile
!/src/
!/include/
!/vendor/
!/resources/
/resources/*
!/resources/distribution/
!/docs/
/docs/*
!/docs/manual/
!/docs/specs/
!/docs/rfc/
!/scripts/
/scripts/*
!/scripts/package.sh
!/scripts/gen-notices.py

# Noise inside the allowed folders.
__pycache__/
*.tmp
*.log
.DS_Store
.env
.env.*
